// Phase 6c — models.mode: "replace" (D-052, completing D-021).
//
// APPLY ONLY AFTER 6b is live AND a test inference through the gateway has
// returned text (PHASE6B_APPLY.md step 4). Not before.
//
// "replace" rewrites models.json from configured providers only and skips the
// plugin-owned catalog shards. Result: the model catalog contains the two
// lmstudio entries and nothing else. D-003 (no cloud tier) stops depending on
// 31 plugins staying individually disabled — an update that re-enables one
// still finds no catalog entry to route to.
//
// The risk D-021 withheld this for: if the catalog comes back empty, the
// gateway starts healthy and fails at first inference, hours later. That is
// why step 5 re-runs the SAME test inference immediately after, and rolls
// back on any failure.
//
//     openclaw config patch --file ops/phase6c.patch.json5 --dry-run
//     openclaw config patch --file ops/phase6c.patch.json5
//     openclaw gateway restart

{
  models: { mode: "replace" },
}
